# ServiceNow SAM Decision Tree - Which Module to Use?

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    %% SAM Decision Tree
    A[Start: What do you need to track?] --> B{Software?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Software Asset Management]
    B -->|No| D{Hardware?}
    
    D -->|Yes| E[Hardware Asset Management]
    D -->|No| F{Buying something?}
    
    F -->|Yes| G[Procurement Management]
    F -->|No| H{Legal agreement?}
    
    H -->|Yes| I[Contract Management]
    H -->|No| J[General Asset Management]
    
    C --> J1[Software License Management]
    C --> J2[Software Installation Tracking]
    
    E --> K[Hardware Asset Tracking]
    E --> L[Asset Lifecycle Management]
    
    G --> M[Purchase Order Workflow]
    G --> N[Vendor Management]
    
    I --> O[Contract Lifecycle]
    I --> P[Renewal Tracking]
    
